Terminal UI provenance and license notices
==========================================

Scope and parity boundary
-------------------------
The fixture file `framework/test/fixtures/gjc-keys-8cd17c0.json` records observable behavior from the frozen Gajae Code reference checkout at commit `8cd17c0f636d3c541c0c2af184e01709b0e6f2c1`. Its expected values describe that reference only; they are not a claim that the framework port is already behavior-identical. The fixture cites source paths, line ranges, input bytes, and SHA-256 hashes so reference behavior can be compared against the port independently.

Pinned GJC reference sources
----------------------------
- `packages/tui/src/components/editor.ts` — editor dispatch, autocomplete, history, newline/submit, and paste handling; SHA-256 `46a67bb0c854e5e25d35f9c4c2559cddc6342073051b731cb36e5288ee16475d`.
- `packages/tui/src/keys.ts` — TypeScript key API and raw backspace platform heuristic; SHA-256 `b274242c9c8aaeb0640bf2bb8e8a52c5271a25a2677f964175f0a44bb995cfed`.
- `packages/tui/src/bracketed-paste.ts` — split-frame paste buffering; SHA-256 `f6a166584b7559cd6616d181d5e0f73f52d0adcc86a71c9660bd55d0972618d8`.
- `packages/tui/src/utils.ts` and `crates/pi-natives/src/text.rs` — ANSI-aware text helpers and native grapheme widths; SHA-256 `17b7a1334359aef3e12921966d6c7b8a24cb148b5e4161567e36d8e41db1b671` and `3ad7ceab0b088732212ec8bd168e8ccd83822d14ce8a6660bae900671c67c644` respectively.

Third-party source attribution
------------------------------

### oh-my-pi

The pinned GJC reference source `crates/pi-natives/src/keys.rs` identifies itself as vendored from oh-my-pi `crates/pi-natives/src/keys.rs` at commit `a85bd5228d9f0f619deade1db78fa49420a721e1`. Its header at GJC lines 1-3 explicitly records GJC-local modifications: retaining GJC key-id validation, raw `0x08` handling, PSMux handling, and modifier hardening. The same source file's SHA-256 in the GJC reference checkout is `0d0082bb7ca46ccf906befea856702eb2209b5506685c10d50087af42226ca83`; the pinned upstream Git blob SHA-1 is `9481ed22c37da47782e673926c5552e2c8933a87`.

The pinned GJC reference source `crates/pi-natives/src/text.rs` identifies itself as vendored from oh-my-pi `crates/pi-natives/src/text.rs` at that same commit. Its header at GJC lines 1-3 records GJC-local modifications: retaining OSC 8 handling, inline-math handling, CRLF correction, two-cell Hangul compatibility-Jamo width, and a private UTF-16 helper. The GJC reference file SHA-256 is `3ad7ceab0b088732212ec8bd168e8ccd83822d14ce8a6660bae900671c67c644`; the pinned upstream Git blob SHA-1 is `7fbbcce928a8b451c874de8a381660331e9fa3ae`.

