### OpenTUI

`packages/tui/src/keys.ts` in the pinned GJC reference labels OpenTUI `packages/core/src/lib/parse.keypress.ts` at commit `7da92b4088aebfe27b9f691c04163a48821e49fd` as a **reference** (GJC `keys.ts:4-6`). This is recorded as reference provenance, not as a claim that the GJC adapter or native parser is an unmodified OpenTUI copy. The pinned OpenTUI source Git blob SHA-1 is `a11f91cf3487fd63d27f547a4a116765d08cddd0`; the GJC reference `packages/tui/src/keys.ts` SHA-256 is `b274242c9c8aaeb0640bf2bb8e8a52c5271a25a2677f964175f0a44bb995cfed`.

